\newlabel{fig:qual}{{6}{7}{Feature maps comparison of ResNet50 and ResNet50+gDS\xspace  . Two cases from two most challenging Instagram filers are shown. (a) ``Lord Kelvin'', (b) ``Toaster''. For each example case, we show the original {\scshape ImageNet}\xspace  image and its Instagram-filtered version. For each image, we also show the activation feature maps after \texttt  {Conv2}, \texttt  {Conv3} and \texttt  {Conv5}, generated by ResNet50 and Resnet50+gDS\xspace  . gDS\xspace  succesfully transforms the features of filtered images to be close to original images (See the diagonal comparisons).}{}{}}
